xGeometry x="370" y="280" width="470" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o3" value="Iceberg 보존 작업&lt;br&gt;DELETE WHERE event_ts &amp;lt; 기한&lt;br&gt;→ expire_snapshots&lt;br&gt;파일 삭제 = delete marker&lt;br&gt;(원본은 비현행으로 Warm 에)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01A88D;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="280" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o4" value="R-3 비현행 만료 1d&lt;br&gt;→ Warm 객체 삭제&lt;br&gt;R-6 고아 delete marker 정리&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;테이블은 항상 정상" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7AA116;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="280" width="270" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="Hot STANDARD" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C72C48;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="540" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="Warm (WARM-TIER)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A1C2E;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="540" width="470" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="ILM 이 기한 지난 파일에 delete marker&lt;br&gt;+ Warm 원본 즉시 삭제 (MinIO 2024-10 실측)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;스냅샷은 여전히 그 파일을 참조 → 조회 실패&lt;br&gt;NotFoundException: Location does not exist" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="540" width="570" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="데이터 수명 — Hot 1일 → Warm → 기한 삭제 (권장 vs 금지)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=22;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="1420" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="예: 보존 5일 (Hot 1일 + Warm 4일) · ILM 실행 시각 = mtime + Days 를 다음 00:00 UTC 로 올림 + Scanner 방문" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1420" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="D0" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="104" y="124" width="32" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="D0&lt;br&gt;적재" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="162" width="180" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="D1" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="364" y="124" width="32" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="D1 → 00:00 UTC&lt;br&gt;Warm 전이" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="162" width="180" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="D5" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="864" y="124" width="32" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="D5&lt;br&gt;보존 기한" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="162" width="180" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="D6" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1144" y="124" width="32" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="D6 → 00:00 UTC&lt;br&gt;Warm 실데이터 삭제" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="162" width="180" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="시험 E-3: age6 파티션 · 전체 스캔 · time travel 모두 실패 / E-4: 같은 데이터를 Iceberg 보존 작업으로 지우면 전체 스캔 · time travel 정상, 지운 파일은 비현행으로 Warm 에 남았다가 R-3 이 회수" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="730" width="1420" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
